cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this research, please cite the repository and research summary."
title: "Project Mandate Research"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "DirkDiggler147"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DirkDiggler147/project-mandate-research"
url: "https://github.com/DirkDiggler147/project-mandate-research"
date-released: 2026-09-05
abstract: >-
  Falsification-led research into portable delegated authority for AI agents
  acting across organisational boundaries. The project evaluated Eclipse
  Biscuit, standards-shaped OAuth delegated authorization, independent
  verifier implementations and black-box conformance testing, and concluded
  that existing mechanisms already provide the core authorization primitive.
keywords:
  - "Eclipse Biscuit"
  - "Biscuit authorization token"
  - "capability security"
  - "offline delegation"
  - "monotonic attenuation"
  - "Datalog authorization"
  - "delegated authorization"
  - "AI agents"
  - "agent security"
  - "OAuth"
  - "authorization research"
